###
# MediFlow pharmacy-service live API collection
#
# IntelliJ users can set `token` globally from auth.http. VS Code users may uncomment
# the next line and use a local development token. Never commit a real token.
# @token = replace-with-local-development-token
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085

### Create prescription
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pharmacy/prescriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: pharmacy-create-demo

{
  "recordId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "patientId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "doctorId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "departmentId": "40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "prescribedDate": "2026-09-04",
  "lines": [
    {
      "drugId": "50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "quantity": 2,
      "dosage": "Uống 1 viên sau ăn sáng và tối"
    }
  ]
}

### Cancel prescription and release reserved stock
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pharmacy/prescriptions/60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: pharmacy-cancel-demo

{
  "reason": "Bác sĩ thay đổi phác đồ điều trị"
}
